<title>UK: UK meals/feeds markets remain in the doldrums.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds markets remain in the doldrums.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK meals and feeds market remained in the doldrums on Thursday with brokers reporting an almost complete lack of interest.</p>
<p>&quot;It's another quiet day in a long line of quiet days,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>Store prices were mostly unchanged but ex-mill high protein soymeal was steadier with offers unchanged to one stg higher.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
